speechtext:
Mr. Speaker, I seek the unanimous consent of the House for leave to move the following motion;
That the House proceed to Private Member's Hour to debate Bill C-204, an Act to declare Canada a nuclear weapons-free zone.
Even though the Tories and the Liberals are trying to muzzle us.

My question will be short;
I do not know whether the Minister's answer will be short. I implore the Minister to give the Hon. Member an opportunity.
The Minister's officials are meeting the MAC today. If he is not prepared today to say what gear types he is planning to reduce, at what rate and at what cost, will he table in the House next week the results of that discussion so that we will know?
